-    with residual unknowns (retains the five baseline pattern decisions). Its
-    confidence concerns that proven defect, not all violations in the cluster.
-    Never infer IMPL from a response mismatch alone. ENV R4 precedes R1 for 503.
+    confirmed/fixed flags cannot establish a fix direction and are not rules.
+    Response-level ENV/5xx evidence applies to each message in that response.
